 {
  "id": "hydrate-pressure",
  "title": "An anomaly as the sensors saw it",
  "takeaway": "One Instance, 37 hours at 1 Hz, labelled as hydrate forming in the production line. Pressure at the tree held near 70 bar, then rose to 112 bar once the anomaly label starts at 10:50.",
